# The Warrior's Path (battlefield.warriors_path, Sealion's Den): areas 2 and 3. Main (7-5 Status 1) enters area 2 (18),
# bob (Status 1) area 3 (19). Each fight is won with bfwin (a GM), not by killing Tenzen: in areas 2 and 3 Tenzen's own
# script raises a Lua error when he falls to 15% HP, before its battlefield:win() (Tenzen.lua:250-259: its taruOffsets
# hold area 1's Taru ids only; not recorded here). Each: 32001 (2, then 3); its finish: the battlefield's two titles,
# and 7-5's own 32001 finish (battlefieldWin is this battlefield, Status 1): Status 2.
lists SealionsDen/_0w0/onTrigger SealionsDen/onEventUpdate/32000 SealionsDen/onEventFinish/32000 SealionsDen/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
charvar Mission[6][748]Status 1
bob: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
bob: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 1
login
trigger _0w0
update 32000 option=18
finish
tick 2000
bfwin
finish
bob: login
bob: trigger _0w0
bob: update 32000 option=19
bob: finish
tick 2000
bob: bfwin
bob: finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
